WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(soft techno music)

00:00:05.287 --> 00:00:08.836
- [Hannu] Darkness is the canvas
and the light is my brush.

00:00:08.836 --> 00:00:09.687
With light painting,

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:13.270
you can create new
world sense of darkness.

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:20.058
My name is Hannu Huhtamo,
and I paint with light.

00:00:26.265 --> 00:00:28.131
I live in Finland.

00:00:28.131 --> 00:00:30.929
We have amazing nature here.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:35.096
We have long summer nights
that are warm and full of light,

00:00:36.081 --> 00:00:40.248
but on the opposite, there
is also this dark part.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.844
It's called polar night.

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:48.011
It starts in December, and
it lasts for about 50 days.

00:00:50.066 --> 00:00:53.899
The sun doesn't rise
above the horizon at all.

00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:58.625
And, for a light painter,
that is quite good.

00:00:59.858 --> 00:01:02.752
I do long exposure photography,

00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:05.317
which is a photographic technique

00:01:05.317 --> 00:01:08.150
that allows me to draw with light.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:14.478
The exposure times can
vary from seconds to hours,

00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:17.679
and the idea is to use the light sources

00:01:17.679 --> 00:01:20.143
as brushes or pencils

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:23.560
and the dark surroundings are the canvas.

00:01:25.768 --> 00:01:30.427
When I start, I might do
some sketches on paper.

00:01:30.427 --> 00:01:33.177
After that, I go to the location,

00:01:34.318 --> 00:01:38.679
I search for details
that I want to emphasize.

00:01:38.679 --> 00:01:41.309
It's sunlight treatment,
it will start to look like

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:43.226
a completely new place.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.740
Going to dark woods or
to an abandoned house,

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:51.111
you first think that, "Oh,
I don't want to go there

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:54.438
"because they are still so
nasty-looking dark places."

00:01:54.438 --> 00:01:58.340
But to light painting, I
have examined these places

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.340
and they look beautiful.

00:02:02.719 --> 00:02:05.219
You see the place differently.

